@startuml CoachifyArchitecture
title Coachify — Dockerised MVP Architecture
top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #52667C
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodeBackgroundColor #F5F8FC
skinparam nodeBorderColor #B9C8DA
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #B9C8DA
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #EEF4FA
skinparam databaseBorderColor #52667C
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam noteBorderColor #D6DFE9

actor "Student" as Student
cloud "Managed authentication\nExternal identity provider" as Identity
cloud "External LLM API\nUsed by CV, career and roadmap services" as LLM

node "Docker Compose environment — 9 containers" as Docker {
  node "Web frontend\n<<container>>\nForms, roadmap editor and dashboard" as Web
  node "API gateway\n<<container>>\nRouting, token checks and request limits" as Gateway

  rectangle "Private backend service network — 6 containers" as Backend {
    node "Student profile service\n<<container>>\n/api/v1/profile\nOwns profile database" as Profile
    node "CV ingestion service\n<<container>>\n/api/v1/cv\nOwns ingestion database" as CV
    node "Career assessment service\n<<container>>\n/api/v1/career\nOwns career database" as Career
    node "Roadmap and task service\n<<container>>\n/api/v1/roadmaps\nOwns roadmap database" as Roadmap
    node "Progress dashboard service\n<<container>>\n/api/v1/dashboard\nStateless API aggregation" as Dashboard
    node "Review and scheduling service\n<<container>>\n/api/v1/reviews and /review-schedules\nOwns review database; includes scheduler" as Review

    Profile -[hidden]right-> CV
    CV -[hidden]right-> Career
    Roadmap -[hidden]right-> Dashboard
    Dashboard -[hidden]right-> Review
    Profile -[hidden]down-> Roadmap
    CV -[hidden]down-> Dashboard
    Career -[hidden]down-> Review
  }

  database "PostgreSQL\n<<container>>\n5 logical databases, separate credentials\nprofile | ingestion | career | roadmap | review" as DB
  storage "Private temporary CV volume\nOnly CV ingestion can access uploads\nVolume, not an additional container" as Uploads
}

Student --> Web : Use application
Student ..> Identity : Sign in
Web --> Gateway : /api/v1 over HTTPS
Gateway ..> Identity : Validate tokens using cached signing keys
Gateway --> Backend : Route to the appropriate service
Backend --> LLM : CV extraction / assessment / plan generation only
Backend --> DB : Five data-owning services use only their own database
Backend --> Uploads : CV service only

note right of Backend
  Internal calls use private authenticated HTTP APIs.
  CV -> Profile: import clarified contributions.
  Career -> Profile: versioned capabilities.
  Roadmap -> Profile / Career: planning inputs.
  Dashboard -> Roadmap / Career / Review: aggregate progress.
  Review -> Profile / Career / Roadmap: analyse and adapt.
  Roadmap -> Review: check automatic-application policy.
end note

note bottom of Docker
  Completing or reopening a task saves history in the roadmap service.
  The frontend automatically refetches the dashboard; no LLM generation is needed.
  Scheduled reviews analyse pace separately and propose or apply revisions.
  Only the frontend and gateway publish host ports. No shared-table access.
end note

legend bottom
  Solid arrows: application/API/data connections
  Dashed arrows: authentication connections
  Each named service is its own container; external providers are outside Docker.
endlegend
@enduml
